DTSTART:20261116T150000Z
DTEND:20261116T160000Z
LOCATION:Virtual
SUMMARY:Miller Architecture Program Virtual Info Session: Application Por
 tfolio Tips
DESCRIPTION:Today's 60-minute Virtual Information Session will offer guid
 ance regarding your application portfolio. Bring your questions to the co
 nversation.  The J. Irwin Miller Master of Architecture program is a thre
 e-year in-residence program\, with a two-year advanced placement track po
 ssible for students who hold a B.Arch from a NAAB-accredited institution 
 or regional equivalent. With our twin studios approach\, students take vi
 sual art course alongside architectural studios to develop their style of
  architectural design. The three-year program welcome applicants from a v
 ariety of educational and career backgrounds.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p class="p1">  Today's 60-minute Virtual In
 formation Session will offer guidance regarding your application portfoli
 o. Bring your questions to the conversation.</p><p class="p1">  The J. Ir
 win Miller Master of Architecture program is a three-year in-residence pr
 ogram\, with a two-year advanced placement track possible for students wh
 o hold a B.Arch from a NAAB-accredited institution or regional equivalent
 . With our twin studios approach\, students take visual art course alongs
 ide architectural studios to develop their style of architectural design.
  The three-year program welcome applicants from a variety of educational 
 and career backgrounds.</p>
