 /artmuseum.indiana.edu/visit/your-visit.html"><span data-contrast="none">
 where to find us\, where to park\, accessibility\, and museum guidelines<
 /span></a><span data-contrast="auto">.</span></p><p><strong>When You Arri
 ve:</strong></p><ul><li>If you parked in the IMU parking lot\, Guest Serv
 ices can validate your parking voucher for a 40% discount.  </li><li>Head
  upstairs to the 2nd Floor and into the Simpson Center for Education to s
 tart.  </li><li>When in the galleries\, do not touch the artwork. Be mind
 ful to keep body parts and anything you're carrying at least 18" away fro
 m the art.  </li><li>Photography is welcome! Just no flash or selfie stic
 ks.  </li></ul>
