 ork by students graduating with a concentration in a variety of studio ar
 eas: graphic design\, painting\, photography\, and sculpture.Closing rece
 ption: Friday\, December 11\, 6–8pmExhibition: Tuesday\, December 1–F
 riday\, December 11.Grunwald Gallery hours: Tuesday–Saturday\, 12–4pm
